   "excerpts": [
    "Thank you, Isabel, and good morning everyone.",
    "In local currency, Mexico had positive comps, while Canada was negative.",
    "The underlying demand in our business was relatively similar to what we saw throughout fiscal 2025, despite greater consumer uncertainty and housing affordability pressure.",
    "Spring is our biggest season, and we feel great about our store readiness, product assortment, and value proposition.",
    "Last week we completed the acquisition of Mingledorff’s, a leading wholesale distributor of heating, ventilation and air conditioning equipment, serving residential and commercial customers through 42 locations in five states across the southeastern United States.",
    "Mingledorff's brings an extensive product portfolio, a robust distribution network, and established customer relationships that are highly complementary to SRS's existing business.",
    "As a reminder, Pro represents a $700 billion market opportunity."
   ],
