   "excerpts": [
    "Thank you, Isabel, and good morning everyone.",
    "Adjusted diluted earnings per share were $14.69 compared to $15.24 in the prior year.",
    "In local currency, Mexico reported positive comps and Canada reported negative comps.",
    "Additionally, storm activity in January provided a sales benefit in the quarter.",
    "Adjusting for storms, underlying demand was relatively stable throughout the year.",
    "In fact, our customers are telling us that our associates continue to deliver exceptional service.",
    "In addition to the GMS acquisition, they completed several tuck in acquisitions and opened a number of greenfield locations across their verticals.",
    "Going forward, we will continue to support SRS’ momentum, and we expect their organic sales to grow midsingle digits in Fiscal 2026.",
    "We remain focused on delivering the best customer experience and value proposition in home improvement."
